data: {"id": "89e90a2ea7e7491d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1719", "run_id": "89e90a2ea7e7491d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到的事实：\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` 当前 phase=Running，但容器 `app` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，restarts=14，exitCode=137（OOMKilled）。\n2. **容器日志（kubectl_previous_logs）**：最近崩溃前的日志显示应用正常启动了24次HTTP /work请求，内存以2MiB步长递增（2-48MiB），所有请求HTTP 200，无错误或异常。这**反驳**了\"应用启动命令错误或二进制缺失\"的假设——二进制存在且能正常启动并处理请求。\n3. **事件**：反复出现 `BackOff restarting failed container`，确认容器反复崩溃。\n4. **容器状态**：`reason=OOMKilled, exitCode=137`。这是 OOM Killer 杀死了进程（SIGKILL），而非命令或二进制问题。\n\n**结论**：\n- 候选原因\"**应用启动命令错误或二进制缺失**\"被日志中24次成功处理HTTP请求的事实**", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788453238835, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "89e90a2ea7e7491d-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "89e90a2ea7e7491d", "seq": 1720, "ts_ms": 1788453248897, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 72.994, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-08", "name": "workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/89e90a2ea7e7491d-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "8f8d9dd8583db45e8b62c10c54cc3186a8e5d43ddb26734eb2d2c61f9404d28c", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "7fc93c408a84570377899dc969b48410c1353c0057397a89f0ecab2dcd4ee6b7"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

